                "description": "- Led implementation of an OSS bookshop eCommerce platform that handles catalogs of 500K+ records and integrates third-party APIs for payments, data ingestion and metadata enrichment, using Laravel, Livewire, JavaScript, PostgreSQL and Meilisearch.\n- Engineered an ETL pipeline to connect a cinema ticketing system with PowerBI, achieving 6x faster KPI checks, cutting manual reporting time by 60%, and enabling tracking of 20+ new KPIs.\n- Automated a legally mandated ICAA compliance report by implementing its encrypted file format spec and integrating it with the ticketing system, cutting the reporting workload by 95%.\n- Implemented a networked ESC/POS thermal ticket-printing system for the cinema POS, driving printers with custom QR code and branding layouts.\n- Led the architecture and full rewrite of a legacy, unstable news platform, introducing Domain-Driven Design and CQRS across the domain model and building a companion Vue CMS — reduced production incidents to 2 in 8 years while increasing publishing volume 30%."
